{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52325","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人数下毕，今我（项校「代」）少高门。\n钱少婢不嫁，财多奴共婚。\n各各服（项校「贩」）父祖，家家卖子孙。\n自言望性（项校「姓」）望，声尽不可论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}